{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":47,"name":"user407","username":"OldHellenic","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/oldhellenic/{size}/29_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-27T17:09:33.076Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-47-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-47-h-1\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e宣传\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e诗 / 抱云轩主\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e-\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你从对面闯来  你从八方奔来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你用肩挑来  你用驴驮来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你的手从书本里长出来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e从电视屏幕中伸出来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e我的耳膜挡不住你断线的珠子\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e笑嘻嘻的飞来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e我卫生间的水龙头  关不住你突突的射来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e我的防盗门  隔不住你重重的敲来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你的狼烟从我的炉子里冒出来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你担子里的千年存货\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e对着我的米缸倾倒进来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你带着铁锈的湿吻\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e对着我的脸贴过来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e总有一天\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e在我看不见  听不着  闻不到的时候\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e我不在意你来与不来\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e总有一天\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你的肩痛  你的驴渴  你的阳光倾斜\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e你的水枪只喷到半空的时候\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e彩虹将从我的骨头里   长出来\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-27T17:14:39.124Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":65.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":33,"topic_slug":"topic","display_username":"user407","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2